# 🛒 E-Commerce API Testing – Postman Project

## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates **API testing of an E-Commerce REST API using Postman**. The project covers authentication, user management, and product APIs with automated test validations.

## 🎯 Testing Objective

The main objectives of this project were to:

* Understand and test REST APIs
* Test different HTTP methods
* Validate API responses and status codes
* Verify response data using test scripts
* Perform positive and negative testing
* Use environment variables for reusable requests
* Execute API tests using Postman Collection Runner

