## 📋 API Test Scripts

Postman JavaScript test scripts were created to automatically validate:

* Status codes
* User IDs
* Product IDs
* Product titles
* Product prices
* Error responses
* Response data

Example:

```javascript
pm.test("Status code is 200", function () {
    pm.response.to.have.status(200);
});
```

